 - Multi-window, 3 monitors - Direct3D 12 (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce RTX 4070 (NVIDIA; 32.0.15.8157) - 13th Gen Intel(R) Core(TM) i9-13900 (32 threads) - 31.74 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\nthe issue is not critical. however the console is spammed with the message:\n ```WARNING: scene/gui/control.cpp:2367 - This control can grab focus only when screen reader is active. Use set_focus_mode() and set_focus_behavior_recursive() to allow a control to get focus. Use get_tree().is_accessibility_enabled() to check screen-reader state.```\nwhenever the scroll wheel is used to change the values of sliders in the colour picker.\n\nthe color picker control node also has the same behaviour when used in a project, outputing this error:\n```W 0:00:02:141   grab_focus: This control can grab focus only when screen reader is active. Use set_focus_mode() and set_focus_behavior_recursive() to allow a control to get focus. Use get_tree().is_accessibility_enabled() to check screen-reader state.```\n\nthe HSlider and VSlider control nodes are unaffected by this issue \n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nadd any node that has a color picker popup, or a Color datatype in the code editor, and use the scroll wheel on a slider to change the value. the console should now be flooded with warnings\nor add a ColorPicker control node, run the project and scroll to change the slider values\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nN/A","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"htt